				"id": "n3",
				"t": 9.5,
				"tempo": 0.93,
				"text": "Suspect one. A six-thousand-token instructions file. *Unread*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n4",
				"t": 14.1,
				"tempo": 0.93,
				"text": "Suspect two. Skills that never *fire*.",
